OL,3,GNEWSARemembrance Sunday evokes memories
OL,4,Aof Isle of Man's war years
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring World War One, more than 8,000
OL,7,Fmen enlisted - some 82.3% of the
OL,8,Feligible population - and 1,165 never
OL,9,Fcame home.
OL,11,FWhen the second conflict began, the
OL,12,Fisland's ferries, which were used to
OL,13,Fship hundreds of thousands of tourists
OL,14,Fa year to the island, responded to the
OL,15,Fcall to action for the mass evacuations
OL,16,Ffrom Dunkirk.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
